Landing page (`landing/`)

Originally a long marketing page with hero + stats + features + architecture + use-cases + quickstart + CTA. Stripped to: header + hero (h1, subhead, copyable install command, tech-info line) + footer. ~120 lines of TSX vs the original 590.

- `INSTALL_CMD` = `'curl -fsSL install.imaginarystorage.com | sudo bash'`.
- `CopyableCommand` uses `navigator.clipboard.writeText`; falls back silently (text is `select-all` so manual copy works).
- Box is `inline-flex` (centered by the parent's `text-center`) so it hugs the command width instead of stretching to `max-w-3xl`.
- Deploys to `nas.imaginarystorage.com` via the existing GitHub Pages workflow (`.github/workflows/landing.yml` — not modified by this work; it picks up `landing/dist/` automatically on push to `main`).

